			],
			"Message": "chore(Sky): Update branding URLs to PlayForm.Cloud instance\n\nMigrate all project references from the legacy `editor.land` and `Editor.Land` domains to the temporary hosting provider `land.playform.cloud`. Update `Public/product.json` to point the documentation URL to the new instance. Revise `README.md` to reflect the new base URL for the logo, project title, documentation links, architecture resources, and maintainer contact email.\n\nThis ensures all public-facing links, badges, and metadata correctly route to the current deployment environment for the Sky component documentation and assets.",
